WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.860
Ghouls are basically glorified vampires that eat human flesh.

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:05.300
That's why this shit's stupidly popular on Tumblr!

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.620
HEY OL' BUDDY OL' PAL!

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:07.600
I'm your BEST FRIEND!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.120
Even though I'm not that actually relevant till the end.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:10.280
GO HIT ON THAT GIRL!!

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:12.160
You mean the edgy teenager who looks like she has daddy issues?

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:12.660
hi

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:13.500
No, THAT ONE.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.840
Do you want to come over for dinner?

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.540
[Fuck yeah she wants to have me for dinner!]

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:18.200
OH GOD SHE'S HAVING ME FOR DINNER!!

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:19.140
Tough luck!

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:21.080
I'm one of the strongest ghouls out there!

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:22.480
Hahahah!

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.560
HAHAHAHA-

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:24.480
(lol)

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:25.560
FALLING PIPES...

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:26.960
MY ONE WEAKNESS!!!

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.380
O-shi-e-te-

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:29.820
*coughing n' shit*

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:30.680
"Nope, can't do it."

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:31.880
Well that date could have gone better.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:36.380
All your organs were ruptured but luckily there was a random lady next to you with all her organs intact!

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:38.680
So we just put them in you, no questions asked!

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.600
That sounds stupidly illegal and irresponsible.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:41.740
I KNOW!

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:42.480
btdubs

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:44.060
If you're a ghoul, you can't eat human food!

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:44.880
(desperation)

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:46.560
[I DON'T WANNA BE A GHOUL]*vomiting in the toilet*

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:47.200
(crying)

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.260
Hey, uh, are you gonna eat that?

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:48.760
*KICK*

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:49.800
What the fuck is wrong with you?

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:50.300
*ANOTHER KICK*

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:50.880
Oh it's you...

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:51.880
eat this human meat.

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:52.380
NO!

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:53.480
I DON'T WANNA BE A GHOUL.

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:54.080
Eat it!

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:55.620
I DON'T WANNA BE A GHOUL!

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:58.260
(Kaneki still crying, spewing unintelligble nonsense)

00:00:58.260 --> 00:00:58.760
*SLAM*

00:00:58.760 --> 00:00:59.740
Nobody gives a shit!

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:01.000
Gramps, he won't stop crying...

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:01.580
can you help?

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:02.160
Drink coffee.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:03.400
Wow, this is great.

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:04.620
See? This isn't so bad-

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:05.300
(Kaneki cries some more)

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:06.280
There he goes again!

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:08.660
C'mon. We need to get you a mask from anime Skrillex.

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:11.060
Hi, I'm anime Skrillex, and I'm not actually gonna do anything in the show.

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:11.920
ME TOO!

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:12.620
Me three.

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:13.180
What about him?

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:15.560
I'm fabulous and a potential pedophile!

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:17.900
Would you like to come back with me for some candy?

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:18.900
[Now Kaneki dear...]

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:22.940
[Remember what Mama told you to say when strange men who are potential pedophiles offer you candy?]

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:23.880
YES!

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:24.960
MOM YOU LIED TO ME!!

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:26.840
Sheesh, it was just a joke.

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:28.600
Here, you can clean up at my place.

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:29.900
[I don't see any harm in that!]

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:36.180
*Take My Breath Awaaayyyy!* (HARMONYYYY!!!)

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:37.620
(gross)

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:41.020
I'm a maniacal sadistic fuck who looks like he raped babies for a living!

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:42.640
I'm the righteous white knight partner!

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:44.660
Who for some reason doesn't care about anything he does.

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:45.540
Oohhh look...

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:46.900
A defenseless little girl!

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:48.100
Would you like some candy?

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:49.360
Don't fall for it it's a trap!

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:50.020
AAGH!

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:51.900
[Where the hell is that Kaneki when I need him?]

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:53.140
Oh what the fuck?

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:57.300
(Kaneki crying and spewing unintelligible nonsense... again)

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:00.040
I LITERALLY HAVE NO IDEA WHAT THE FUCK YOU'RE TALKING ABOUT!

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:00.860
*WHOOPS*

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:02.000
[Oh God what have I done]

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:03.840
Shh, It's okay, have a Snickers.

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:05.940
I can't believe I got killed by a little girl!

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:07.280
Serves you right you sadistic-

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:07.920
[Wait a minute]

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:11.000
*climax intestifies*

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.660
[I LEFT THE STOVE ON!]

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:13.820
[oh and he was married]

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:14.660
...

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:15.900
nooooooo....

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:17.220
I'm looking for my sister.

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:18.000
Nii-ssan?

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:18.820
He's your brother?!

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:20.100
(dun Dun DUU-)

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:21.620
Well, you two DO look very alike.

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:22.360
*Jason fucks up Kaneki*

00:02:22.360 --> 00:02:23.580
Kaneki's been kidnapped!

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:25.120
Oh I'm sure he's doing fine!

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:28.540
(Screaming in the background) Ninety nine bottles of beer on the wall. Ninety nine bottles of beer!

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:30.800
Alright, I GUESS we can get him.

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:32.580
