00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:35.040
BECAUSE I'M A WALKING COPYRIGHT INFRINGEMENT!!!

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:36.580
Haha, you look pathetic.

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:38.700
