00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:39.280
Fuck you.

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:40.320
Hax mode: ON!

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:40.820
What?!

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:42.240
Why has your hair turned white?

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:43.860
'Cause it makes me look more badass.

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:45.420
So why have your nails turned black?

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:46.380
'Cause it makes me look

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:47.980
FABULLOOUUUSSSS!!!!

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:48.800
(Jason jealous of Kaneki's fab)

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:51.440
It's the most dangerous Ghoul of all time...

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:52.880
The One-eyed Owl.

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.180
Woah Kaneki you look different.

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:55.960
I am not Kaneki anymore,

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:57.420
I am...

00:02:57.700 --> 00:02:58.620
Kan-edgy.

00:02:58.620 --> 00:03:00.460
*silence*

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:01.600
Fuck you I have white hair.

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:02.800
So, are you coming back with us?

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:04.840
Thanks, but Imma join the people who kidnapped and tortured me.

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:06.180
What? That makes no sense!

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:07.540
Probably does in the manga!

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:11.340
I'll always remember your physically deformed face as you were trying to slaughter children.

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:13.240
Hey hotness, what brings you to this grave?

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:13.880
He's my dad.

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:14.580
HE'S YOUR WHAT?

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:17.540
We were so desperate for new recruits we even hired a small boy!

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:18.520
Why are you a girl?

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:19.240
I DUNNO!

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:20.560
Will you be my daddy?

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:22.740
Sure. Just make sure to behave yourse-

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:25.520
